{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>無綫集團員工飯堂疑聘請非法勞工</figcaption></figure><p>無綫集團員工飯堂疑聘請非法勞工，據了解一名越南籍女子被捕。 據了解於2020年受聘 勞工處於無綫集團員工飯堂例行巡查，發現一名女洗碗工的身份證有可疑，報警處理。警方查核後發現身份證失效，拘捕該名越南籍女子。據了解飯堂由外判商營運，女子於2020年受聘，月薪2萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:22:37.029413+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:16:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:18:01.135275+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:18:01.135275+00:00","content_hash":"0d5ae28a7ac92dae87d99385dc106b8cf894624cedbce744c2f377fe250e6f7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}